== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|nr}} The item's pickup quote references the tagline of the [[wikipedia:Pokemon|Pokémon]] games. The quote said "Gotta catch 'em all?".
** The updated quote is also a Pokémon reference, with Bug Catchers being common low-level trainers that appear in foresty areas in most Pokémon games.
* {{dlc|a+}} With [[Booster Packs#Booster Pack #2|Booster Pack #2]], this item's sprite fills up with more flies depending on how many flies it contains. This is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=840463618 this Steam Workshop mod] by Stewartisme.

